WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:11.550
Here's how to add a family member to your Volunteer Hub page. A spouse, a student, a grandparent: anyone who shares your email can get their own spot on the list.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:18.090
Step one. Open your volunteer page, and tap Update my info and paperwork.

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:25.200
Step two. Tap Add another person on this email. It's right under your own paperwork status.

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:35.260
Step three. Your email is already filled in, and it's locked on purpose. Everyone in the family shares it, so you all get the same Hub emails.

00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:44.921
Step four. Fill in their info: name, phone, shirt size, and group. If they're under eighteen, tap Yes, and add a parent and a parent phone.

00:00:45.121 --> 00:00:49.040
In the last box, type the student their hours count for.

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:58.531
Step five. Open each document you have, and upload a photo or a screenshot. Don't have it yet? Skip it. They can upload it later.

00:00:58.731 --> 00:01:00.700
Then tap Submit.

00:01:01.550 --> 00:01:08.410
Step six. Check that everything is right, then tap Yes, save it. If anything's off, tap Fix something.

00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:17.830
That's it! They now show up at the top of your page. Tap their name to add them to this phone, then switch between family members anytime.

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:23.620
Questions? Email the IU liaison from the bottom of any Hub page.
